    "wire_match": "one-to-one direction-invariant two-point edge matching within Hungarian-matched logical nets; pool source branches sharing a global power rail",
    "connectivity_match": "merge nets sharing global power rails, then Hungarian one-to-one mixed-vertex-set soft F1",
    "connectivity_vertex_identity": "IC: component key + port; ordinary: component key; ground/supply: global rail",
